res.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Attempted login with non-existent email (nonexistent@test.com) and password. The login was rejected - the page remained on /login and did not redirect to home page, indicating no authenticated session was created.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Cannot test duplicate email rejection due to broken registration system\", \"actual\": \"Registration system does not create accounts. Attempted registration completes without error but account cannot be verified to exist or to reject duplicates. Cannot proceed with testing duplicate email rejection.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Cannot test wrong password rejection - demo accounts accept any password, cannot create new account for testing\", \"actual\": \"Demo accounts (emma@example.com, marcus@example.com, sofia@example.com) accept any password by design. Custom account registration is broken. Cannot test that incorrect passwords are properly rejected for legitimate accounts.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Cannot test seller action visibility due to inability to create own listings or access seller dashboard\", \"actual\": \"Blocked by FT-1 and authentication issues. Cannot access own listings to verify seller management buttons are present, nor can verify they're absent from other users' listings due to session instability.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Cannot test form validation for listing creation due to missing/broken listing form\", \"actual\": \"No accessible listing creation form found. /create-listing endpoint returns empty page. Attempted registration form does not create accounts. Cannot verify required field validation.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", 